<title>UK: Argentina's Autopistas plans $380 mln bond - bankers.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Autopistas plans $380 mln bond - bankers.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Autopistas plans to launch a $380 million two-tranche bond issue, bankers said on Friday.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to be lead managed by Citibank and Goldman Sachs International.</p>
<p>Roadshows begin today in Buenos Aires, and continue until July 21. --Denise Manning, London newsroom,  +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
